  "version": 1,
  "notes": "Look presets for the explainer style. `look` holds the look fields a preset implies (theme; the recipe is derived as look-<id>), `knobs` the style-recipe knobs applied to the middle scenes (styles/vocabulary.py closed sets), `emphasis` the scene types the writer is asked to prefer, `registry` the HyperFrames registry items the look is built with (installed under hf_template_explainer/compositions, adapted inline in index.html), `thumbnail` a path under newsletter_video/ui/static. `colors` holds the look's default background and accent (the template's own values); the panel's swatches and the colour guard live in newsletter_video/colors.py.",
